      "name": "Minimum Information About a Peptide Array Experiment (MIAPepAE)",
      "description": "A 'Minimum Information' guideline/checklist defining the data and metadata that should accompany peptide-array (protein/peptide array) experiments to enable reproducible, high-quality reporting. Covers experimental details, array types (including in situ synthesized arrays), detection/quantitation methods, and required metadata for peptide-array screening and related applications."
